flowchart TB
  accTitle: Rules geography - layered agent rules
  accDescr: The shared reference clone provides canonical skills and policy to personal overlays, machine-local harness configuration, skill discovery, harness always-on rules, and each repository's additive AGENTS.md.

  subgraph TOP["Rules geography - layered"]
    direction LR
    SHARED["1. Shared reference<br/>$AGENT_RULES_PATH<br/>dev-centr/agent-rules<br/><br/>user.md | general/*<br/>AGENTS.md | agents/*<br/>skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md<br/><br/>Canonical skills and shared policy"]
    PERSONAL["2. Personal overlay<br/>optional personal fork<br/><br/>profiles/&lt;machine&gt;.md<br/>personal user.md tweaks<br/>personal-only skills/<br/><br/>Deltas, not a HEAD-parity mirror"]
    ANTI["Anti-pattern<br/><br/>Chasing parity between<br/>personal fork and<br/>template HEAD"]
  end

  subgraph BOTTOM["Machine and repository"]
    direction LR
    MACHINE["5. This machine<br/>$CODE_ROOT/harness.md<br/>discovery, always-on, sync stamp<br/><br/>$CODE_ROOT/machine.md<br/>workstation facts<br/><br/>$LOCAL_RULES_DIR<br/>device-local overlay"]
    DISCOVERY["4. Skill discovery<br/>$SKILLS_DISCOVERY_ROOT/&lt;name&gt;/<br/><br/>Junction or copy from<br/>canonical skills"]
    ALWAYS["3. Harness always-on<br/>user.md then AGENTS.md<br/><br/>Compose with rules-manager<br/>when the harness cannot stack"]
    PROJECT["6. Repository under edit<br/>&lt;repo&gt;/AGENTS.md<br/><br/>Project facts only<br/>additive to portable and org<br/><br/>No machine paths<br/>no copied skill bodies"]
  end

  SHARED -. canonical source .-> PERSONAL
  SHARED -. installs .-> DISCOVERY
  SHARED -. sync stamp .-> MACHINE
  DISCOVERY --> ALWAYS
  ALWAYS --> PROJECT

  classDef shared fill:#e8f0ea,stroke:#334155
  classDef personal fill:#f3ebe3,stroke:#92400e
  classDef warning fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c
  classDef machine fill:#e8eef4,stroke:#2563eb
  classDef neutral fill:#ffffff,stroke:#475569
  classDef project fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569
  class SHARED shared
  class PERSONAL personal
  class ANTI warning
  class MACHINE machine
  class DISCOVERY,ALWAYS neutral
  class PROJECT project
